="Scorpion451" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1918720)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpion451" >Scorpion451</a></span> 的 <strong><a style="color:#9C6014" href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scorpion-pit">蝎子洞</a></strong> 。<br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><em>不得不说这份艺作里的其他作品也是十分对我胃口的、不可多得的好货。</em></span></p> </blockquote> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;SCP-1000&nbsp;花开之日</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;SCP-1000&nbsp;花开之日</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-left" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://orig00.deviantart.net/414b/f/2016/143/a/d/scp_1000___the_day_of_flowers_by_sunnyclockwork-da3h0aq.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="scp_1000___the_day_of_flowers_by_sunnyclockwork-da3h0aq.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>SCP-1000 - Bigfoot (The Day of Flowers)</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <blockquote> <p>来自 <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1621343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608323378" alt="SunnyClockwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1621343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" >SunnyClockwork</a></span> 的 <strong><a style="color:dark_red" href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/sunny-s-black-and-white-art">SunnyClockwork的艺作中心页</a></strong> 。<br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><em>没啥好说的。阳阳，永远滴神。没看过的话建议你们都去看一下。</em></span></p> </blockquote> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;SCP-3502</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;SCP-3502</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/yuannnzhe/2" style="width:300px;" alt="2" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>SCP-3502 (袋鼠路牌)</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <blockquote> <p>来自 <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6062512&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608323378" alt="YUANNN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6062512)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" >YUANNN</a></span> 的 <strong><a style="color:purple" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yuannn-artwork">什么？你居然捡到了Dr.Yuannn的艺作生成器</a></strong> 。<br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><em>阿园大大的画作有一种简单清新的风格，虽然简单但是完成度非常高，画风也很戳我。非常可爱，建议大家都去看。</em></span></p> </blockquote> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;SCP-173</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;SCP-173</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/dwagon-s-anomalous-art-den/173.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="173.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>最初之作</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <blockquote> <p>来自 <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floofy-dwagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1475320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608323378" alt="Floofy Dwagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1475320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floofy-dwagon" >Floofy Dwagon</a></span> 的 <strong><a style="color:grey" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/dwagon-s-anomalous-art-den">Dwagon的异常艺术小窝</a></strong> 。<br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><em>壁纸设计者。反正很好看就是了。</em></span></p> </blockquote> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-6" style="display:none"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <p><strong>因为这次竞赛我是主办方之一，所以只能搞一个时间顺序列表，而不能搞评分总排行了……这于情理上说不通。总排行可以去看十三或者句号的人事页。</strong></p> <hr /></div> <h1><span>所有参赛作品</span></h1> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">显示所有参赛作品</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">这鬼东西真的太长了收起来吧</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <hr /> <h1><span><strong>待删除：</strong></span></h1> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">这鬼东西真的太长了收起来吧</a></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h1><span>竞赛主页</span></h1> <hr /> <h1><span>第一赛道</span></h1> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">显示第一赛道作品</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">这鬼东西真的太长了收起来吧</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">这鬼东西真的太长了收起来吧</a></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h1><span>第二赛道</span></h1> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">显示第二赛道作品</a></